{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mark\u2019s Power is an atmospheric adventure about strength, choice, and consequences.</strong><br>Travel across an unfamiliar planet where friendly smiles may hide hidden motives. Explore locations, gather resources, craft, engage in turn-based battles, and choose your own way forward \u2014 honorable or not.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768320/extras/ddbbcd030ac47c1d2f070e21a97bc953.poster.avif?t=1763710721\" width=698 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768320/extras/ddbbcd030ac47c1d2f070e21a97bc953.webm?t=1763710721\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768320/extras/ddbbcd030ac47c1d2f070e21a97bc953.mp4?t=1763710721\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use Mark\u2019s technological superiority, but remember: every decision shapes the ending. The game invites you to reflect on the nature of power and what happens when no one can stop you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768320/extras/b7d0b6bc9ca6258e70defda13a52128b.avif?t=1763710721\" width=900 height=317 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:<br>\u2022 world exploration and character interactions<br>\u2022 crafting, gathering, and mini-games<br>\u2022 a unique trading system without fixed prices<br>\u2022 turn-based tactical combat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768320/extras/e76ef5fac8f5308a1a6f1fcaadde2a0a.avif?t=1763710721\" width=900 height=212 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Created by a solo developer, the game doesn\u2019t aim to impress with graphics \u2014 its strength lies in atmosphere, ideas, and a heartfelt adventure that stays with you. Dive in and enjoy the journey.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2768320?t=1763710721","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768320/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1763710721","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768320/5ab76830f56817446a3dcb3a82df8b8cae1ebd71/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763710721","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768320/5ab76830f56817446a3dcb3a82df8b8cae1ebd71/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763710721","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":2768330,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mark\u2019s Power is an atmospheric adventure about strength, choice, and consequences.</strong><br>Travel across an unfamiliar planet where friendly smiles may hide hidden motives. Explore locations, gather resources, craft, engage in turn-based battles, and choose your own way forward \u2014 honorable or not.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768320/extras/ddbbcd030ac47c1d2f070e21a97bc953.poster.avif?t=1763710721\" width=698 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768320/extras/ddbbcd030ac47c1d2f070e21a97bc953.webm?t=1763710721\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768320/extras/ddbbcd030ac47c1d2f070e21a97bc953.mp4?t=1763710721\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use Mark\u2019s technological superiority, but remember: every decision shapes the ending. The game invites you to reflect on the nature of power and what happens when no one can stop you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768320/extras/b7d0b6bc9ca6258e70defda13a52128b.avif?t=1763710721\" width=900 height=317 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:<br>\u2022 world exploration and character interactions<br>\u2022 crafting, gathering, and mini-games<br>\u2022 a unique trading system without fixed prices<br>\u2022 turn-based tactical combat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768320/extras/e76ef5fac8f5308a1a6f1fcaadde2a0a.avif?t=1763710721\" width=900 height=212 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Created by a solo developer, the game doesn\u2019t aim to impress with graphics \u2014 its strength lies in atmosphere, ideas, and a heartfelt adventure that stays with you. Dive in and enjoy the journey.</p>","developers":["\u0414\u043c\u0438\u0442\u0440\u0438\u0439 \u0417\u0430\u043b\u0435\u0442\u043e\u0432"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768320/2046152d9bb78bcf445a5d82905ff44f23d5b6c3/header.jpg?t=1763710721","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommend